  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WBG Joint Capital Markets Program (J-CAP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WBG&#x2019;s Joint Capital Markets Program (J-CAP) is a new initiative led by IFC as a World Bank Group (WBG) joint
initiative and coordinated by a dedicated cross-WBG secretariat. The programme objective is to help countries crowd-in new investments and sustainably finance for implementation of key development programs.</narrative>
  </description>
